'''Festival Sign Girl''' (文化祭のカンバン娘 ''Bunkamatsuri no Kanban Musume'', '''Cultural Festival Signboard Girl''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[A Cultured Festival]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Festival Sign Girl
|image = E 281.png
|appearance = [[A Cultured Festival]]<br>
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 4|Infernal Tower - Floor 4]]
|money drop = 300¢ - 1,185¢
}}

==Enemy==
Acts essentially like [[Ms. Sign]], just with a different sign featuring [[Doge]], [[Snache]] and [[Teacher Bear]] and somewhat stronger, with less health but a lot less knockbacks. Pretty much a ranged peon stat-wise, though.

==Strategy==
Treat this enemy like Ms. Sign, any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] will make quick work of her.

